    "text": "Champions League 2017 Okayama was held at the Orange Hall of the Okayama Prefecture wholesale center on 14 May 2017, one of the season's seven tournaments, which earned Championship Points toward Japan's national final in June. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Decoration, with the year and the city in the foil, in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
